Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsuda, what's this I hear\Nabout you buying a romance-bot?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, I—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.26,0:00:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Tsuda, tell me you're\Nnot that kind of criminal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, guys—!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's all right, master.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.60,0:00:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can stay with me forever and ever.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,NOOOOOOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.69,0:00:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just... a dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.65,0:00:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how cozily she's sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait... but robots don't sleep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she broken?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe her battery ran dry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.37,0:00:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She {\i1}has{\i0} been up and\Nrunning since she got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.09,0:00:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There, that should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.67,0:00:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, where's her power button?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.47,0:01:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Maybe on her back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.64,0:01:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe in front?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.60,0:01:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a mole.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, l am being\N{\i1}such{\i0} a pervert right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.78,0:01:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I can't leave her like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.91,0:01:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A QR code!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.24,0:01:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can learn something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.08,0:01:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you for your purchase!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.67,0:01:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This video will serve as your user\Nmanual for your Nadeshiko sex android!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's start with booting her up!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.26,0:01:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do I even need to boot her back up?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't want to get rid of her,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.23,0:01:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but maybe I should leave her as she is.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.11,0:01:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right!\NI forgot I ordered this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.82,0:01:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.82,0:01:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To activate the unit,\Ngive it a French kiss!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.41,0:02:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gently press the switch\Ninside the unit's mouth!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.75,0:02:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where is it? Where's the switch?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.75,0:02:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.13,0:02:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't wake up so\NI was sure you were broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.14,0:02:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot to recharge my battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.85,0:02:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I wasn't\Nthinking about it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, come...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, master? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.61,0:02:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All I had that fit you was a schoolgirl\Nuniform, so I bought you this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.32,0:02:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It has more of a cosplay\Nyibe than I expected, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks great on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're adorable, Nadeshiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.79,0:02:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just call me by my name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You did! You've never done that before!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.71,0:02:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.05,0:02:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I want you to keep\Naddressing me like that more and more!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.13,0:03:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh. Oh, no...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.94,0:03:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's so cute...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, while you're sleeping,\NI'll go into sleep mode as well, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.72,0:03:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can awake me from sleep mode\Nthe same way you rebooted, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.98,0:03:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The same as rebooting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.11,0:03:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a functional limitation\Nof master registration.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs60\shad0\c&H030303&\blur1\3c&HF0EFFF&\bord9\fnChinacat\pos(286,38)}AUTHENTIFICATION
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.19,0:03:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were registered, you could reuse\Nme from sleep mode via voice command.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\a6\bord1.5\shad0\blur0.7\fsp10\c&H6863D5&\pos(892,390)\frz69.82\fnGuava Candy}NA{\alpha&FF&\t(106,106,\alpha&00&)}DE{\alpha&FF&\t(189,189,\alpha&00&)}SHI{\alpha&FF&\t(273,273,\alpha&00&)}KO{\alpha&FF&\t(356,356,\alpha&00&)}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can complete master registration,\Nor manually wake me every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,440)\fs35\bord2.5\blur0.5\b1\pos(1584,378)\shad0\3c&HD0377A&\c&HF7FFFC&\fnA-OTF Shin Go Pro R}Brought to you by ToonsHub
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Which do you prefer, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do eitherrrr!
